      "image": "assets/images/239047/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large, deep skillet over medium heat. Add onion with a pinch of salt; cook and stir until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir in sausage and cook until browned, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2PSk1lSfmN_rzIrgGmKYkIrbmhI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-239047-one-pan-orecchiette-pasta-VAT-step-02-1-0912510ce68344229e43a24d5e3660e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239047/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 1 1/2 cups chicken broth into sausage mixture and bring to a boil while scraping the browned bits of food off of the bottom of the pan with a wooden spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pRFwDIj17ZNiHSXLPOZULpMfkkA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-239047-one-pan-orecchiette-pasta-VAT-step-03-271fb61420584e40961c83dcf3b05b39.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/239047/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add orecchiette pasta; cook and stir pasta in hot broth, adding remaining broth when liquid is absorbed, until pasta is cooked through and most of the broth is absorbed, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
